": "ffxbld", "branch": "default", "desc": "No bug, Automated HSTS preload list update from host bld-linux64-spot-306 - a=hsts-update", "files": ["security/manager/ssl/nsSTSPreloadList.errors", "security/manager/ssl/nsSTSPreloadList.inc"], "git_node": null, "git_parents": [null], "node": "4f5625525ded6d852bda471c12a21636d77bf735", "parents": ["e6132f638311978445187a90288c1611028e26b3"], "tags": []}, {"author": "ffxbld", "branch": "default", "desc": "No bug, Automated HPKP preload list update from host bld-linux64-spot-306 - a=hpkp-update", "files": ["security/manager/ssl/StaticHPKPins.h"], "git_node": null, "git_parents": [null], "node": "26252ef9b45f6dd9d854dd6a08399d2e54d80470", "parents": ["4f5625525ded6d852bda471c12a21636d77bf735"], "tags": []}], "date": 1490280340, "git_changesets": [null, null], "user": "ffxbld"}, "6970": {"changesets": [{"author": "Wes Kocher \u003cwkocher@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Backed out 2 changesets (bug 1337392) for test_browserElement_inproc_SetInputMethodActive.html failures a=backout\n\nBacked out changeset 36953ede0e59 (bug 1337392)\nBacked out changeset cf8216fc3b25 (bug 1337392)", "files": ["accessible/tests/mochitest/jsat/test_content_text.html", "accessible/tests/mochitest/states/test_inputs.html", "devtools/client/netmonitor/test/browser_net_resend.js", "dom/html/test/test_bug613019.html", "editor/libeditor/tests/test_bug850043.html", "layout/base/tests/bug1082486-1.html", "layout/base/tests/bug646382-1-ref.html", "layout/base/tests/bug646382-2-ref.html", "layout/base/tests/bug664087-1-ref.html", "layout/base/tests/bug664087-2-ref.html", "layout/base/tests/bug956530-1.html", "layout/base/tests/input-maxlength-invalid-change.html", "layout/base/tests/input-maxlength-ui-invalid-change.html", "layout/base/tests/input-maxlength-ui-valid-change.html", "layout/base/tests/input-maxlength-valid-change.html", "layout/base/tests/input-minlength-invalid-change.html", "layout/base/tests/input-minlength-ui-invalid-change.html", "layout/base/tests/input-minlength-ui-valid-change.html", "layout/base/tests/input-minlength-valid-change.html", "layout/base/tests/textarea-maxlength-invalid-change.html", "layout/base/tests/textarea-maxlength-ui-invalid-change.html", "layout/base/tests/textarea-maxlength-ui-valid-change.html", "layout/base/tests/textarea-maxlength-valid-change.html", "layout/base/tests/textarea-minlength-invalid-change.html", "layout/base/tests/textarea-minlength-ui-invalid-change.html", "layout/base/tests/textarea-minlength-ui-valid-change.html", "layout/base/tests/textarea-minlength-valid-change.html", "layout/forms/nsTextControlFrame.cpp", "layout/forms/test/bug287446_subframe.html", "layout/forms/test/test_bug353539.html", "layout/forms/test/test_bug534785.html", "layout/reftests/bugs/240933-1.html", "widget/tests/test_native_key_bindings_mac.html"], "git_node": null, "git_parents": [null], "node": "c4f5a1f6d6769a1670d457fe9fd968b19c06bfd0", "parents": ["26252ef9b45f6dd9d854dd6a08399d2e54d80470"], "tags": []}], "date": 1490291564, "git_changesets": [null], "user": "kwierso@gmail.com"}, "6971": {"changesets": [{"author": "Lee Salzman \u003clsalzman@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "FIREFOX_ESR_52_0_X_RELBRANCH", "desc": "Bug 1347094 - Fix SkiaGL canvas drawing of large images. r=mchang, a=jcristau\n\nMozReview-Commit-ID: Cw5EkXQj06t", "files": ["gfx/skia/skia/src/gpu/SkGpuDevice.cpp"], "git_node": null, "git_parents": [null], "node": "c5d2d97570911a8bd1072c42ac492b396d81b5ef", "parents": ["d18e41baad4bb1b8b6d808a840a7e9db24afb671"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Hiroyuki Ikezoe \u003chiikezoe@mozilla-japan.org\u003e", "branch": "FIREFOX_ESR_52_0_X_RELBRANCH", "desc": "Bug 1318697 - Skip composing styles for properties depending on cascade level. r=birtles, a=jcristau\n\nWhen we are composing style for the Animations level of the cascade,\nif we have transitions-level animations, we *also* need to compose them if we\nhave animations-level animations that build on top of them using additive or\naccumulative composite modes.\n\nHowever, we should not build those transitions-level animations unless they will\nbe built on or overridden by a regular animations-level animation. Otherwise\nwe will end up with transitions-level animations in the animations-level and\nwhile transitions-level will override the animations-level in the cascade,\nonce the transition finishes there will be nothing to remove the cached\nanimations-level animation rule.\n\nMozReview-Commit-ID: LaRabzDSsO5", "files": ["dom/animation/EffectCompositor.cpp", "layout/reftests/css-transitions/reftest.list", "layout/reftests/css-transitions/transition-and-animation-with-different-durations-ref.html", "layout/reftests/css-transitions/transition-and-animation-with-different-durations.html", "layout/style/nsCSSPropertyIDSet.h"], "git_node": null, "git_parents": [null], "node": "afa66bcf9203e691f164e5e8a9cc8fad783ccddc", "parents": ["c5d2d97570911a8bd1072c42ac492b396d81b5ef"], "tags": ["FIREFOX_52_0_2esr_BUILD1", "FIREFOX_52_0_2esr_RELEASE"]}], "date": 1490292255, "git_changesets": [null, null], "user": "ryanvm@gmail.com"}, "6972": {"changesets": [{"author": "Hiroyuki Ikezoe \u003chiikezoe@mozilla-japan.org\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 1318697 - Skip composing styles for properties depending on cascade level. r=birtles, a=jcristau\n\nWhen we are composing style for the Animations level of the cascade,\nif we have transitions-level animations, we *also* need to compose them if we\nhave animations-level animations that build on top of them using additive or\naccumulative composite modes.\n\nHowever, we should not build those transitions-level animations unless they will\nbe built on or overridden by a regular animations-level animation. Otherwise\nwe will end up with transitions-level animations in the animations-level and\nwhile transitions-level will override the animations-level in the cascade,\nonce the transition finishes there will be nothing to remove the cached\nanimations-level animation rule.\n\nMozReview-Commit-ID: LaRabzDSsO5", "files": ["dom/animation/EffectCompositor.cpp", "layout/reftests/css-transitions/reftest.list", "layout/reftests/css-transitions/transition-and-animation-with-different-durations-ref.html", "layout/reftests/css-transitions/transition-and-animation-with-different-durations.html", "layout/style/nsCSSPropertyIDSet.h"], "git_node": null, "git_parents": [null], "node": "ee46acc0eeb2c3590cc6baa15f1f8fddfc5fff4c", "parents": ["c4f5a1f6d6769a1670d457fe9fd968b19c06bfd0"], "tags": []}], "date": 1490292323, "git_changesets": [null], "user": "ryanvm@gmail.com"}, "6973": {"changesets": [{"author": "ffxbld", "branch": "default", "desc": "No bug, Automated HSTS preload list update from host bld-linux64-spot-347 - a=hsts-update", "files": ["security/manager/ssl/nsSTSPreloadList.errors", "security/manager/ssl/nsSTSPreloadList.inc"], "git_node": null, "git_parents": [null], "node": "0ad0682a9676d9e13a58a02cc4e1e814e207fc78", "parents": ["ee46acc0eeb2c3590cc6baa15f1f8fddfc5fff4c"], "tags": []}, {"author": "ffxbld", "branch": "default", "desc": "No bug, Automated HPKP preload list update from host bld-linux64-spot-347 - a=hpkp-update", "files": ["security/manager/ssl/StaticHPKPins.h"], "git_node": null, "git_parents": [null], "node": "166693fdd7139716e6099d033aea29c3ddc667a6", "parents": ["0ad0682a9676d9e13a58a02cc4e1e814e207fc78"], "tags": []}], "date": 1490365905, "git_changesets": [null, null], "user": "ffxbld"}, "6974": {"changesets": [{"author": "Bob Owen \u003cbobowencode@gmail.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 1342395 - Unwrap aPattern in DrawTargetRecording::FillGlyphs when calling wrapped DrawTarget. r=jrmuizel, a=jcristau", "files": ["gfx/2d/DrawTargetRecording.cpp"], "git_node": null, "git_parents": [null], "node": "0e0e8abe215317d2461bcfe853dd815f5a482305", "parents": ["166693fdd7139716e6099d033aea29c3ddc667a6"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Jonathan Kew \u003cjkew@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 1342841 - Use Leelawadi UI as fallback for more scripts than just Thai, as it has additional character support. r=m_kato, a=jcristau", "files": ["gfx/thebes/gfxWindowsPlatform.cpp"], "git_node": null, "git_parents": [null], "node": "623afac083f8f03fe720620dfa800057edb5c996", "parents": ["0e0e8abe215317d2461bcfe853dd815f5a482305"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Gijs Kruitbosch \u003cgijskruitbosch@gmail.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 1344644 - Stop supporting outdated Edge bookmarks format to avoid hangs trying to open bookmarks database when Edge is open. r=dao, a=jcristau\n\nMozReview-Commit-ID: 2KihobvE8nV", "files": ["browser/components/migration/EdgeProfileMigrator.js"], "git_node": null, "git_parents": [null], "node": "cac0735c228f1038be5ae4219f3c454096e1bc91", "parents": ["623afac083f8f03fe720620dfa800057edb5c996"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Martin Husemann \u003cmartin@NetBSD.ORG\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 1322660 - Use memcpy() in WOFF2 code instead of dereferencing a pointer after casting to a type with different alignment requirements. r=jfkthame a=jcristau", "files": ["modules/woff2/src/store_bytes.h", "modules/woff2/src/woff2_common.cc"], "git_node": null, "git_parents": [null], "node": "9d6d60e64255cd8a6a3ecb634d4f426d7c44226c", "parents": ["cac0735c228f1038be5ae4219f3c454096e1bc91"], "tags": []}, {"author": "D\u00e3o Gottwald \u003cdao@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 1343330 - Use fast-forward and fast-rewind characters instead of skip-to-end and skip-to-start on Windows 7. r=Felipe a=jcristau\n\nMozReview-Commit-ID: LUfyeUcDkmC", "files": ["toolkit/components/printing/content/printPreviewBindings.xml"], "git_node": null, "git_parents": [null], "node": "6f23bd449bc7ca2aa9d804ffd21c2b155c16a80b", "parents": ["9d6d60e64255cd8a6a3ecb634d4f426d7c44226c"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Karl Tomlinson \u003ckarlt+@karlt.net\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 1346961 draw opaque scrollbar background on outermost scrollbar element even for GTK versions \u003e= 3.20 r=jhorak a=jcristau\n\nMozReview-Commit-ID: BHsD1h4UQbs", "files": ["widget/gtk/gtk3drawing.cpp"], "git_node": null, "git_parents": [null], "node": "3a2dc54cf9861bd5708730c7bb8240d99a780e2e", "parents": ["6f23bd449bc7ca2aa9d804ffd21c2b155c16a80b"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Wes Kocher \u003cwkocher@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 1318070 - Make sure multi-word queries are rejected when keyword.enabled is false r=mak a=jcristau\n\nMozReview-Commit-ID: 6kMU2oTy456", "files": ["toolkit/components/places/UnifiedComplete.js", "toolkit/components/places/tests/unifiedcomplete/test_visit_url.js"], "git_node": null, "git_parents": [null], "node": "a68d6d9b87d0a5ea6b9160d5fef0485bd072fc6b", "parents": ["3a2dc54cf9861bd5708730c7bb8240d99a780e2e"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Gerald Squelart \u003cgsquelart@squelart.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 1346648 - Better pointer checks - r=cpearce a=jcristau", "files": ["media/gmp-clearkey/0.1/ClearKeyDecryptionManager.cpp"], "git_node": null, "git_parents": [null], "node": "6684a3c7f834b765624f437ebf943c469d1f44b1", "parents": ["a68d6d9b87d0a5ea6b9160d5fef0485bd072fc6b"], "tags": []}, {"author": "JW Wang \u003cjwwang@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 1336345 - Register shutdown blocker only once when the 1st MediaDecoder is created. r=gerald a=jcristau", "files": ["dom/media/MediaDecoder.cpp", "dom/media/MediaShutdownManager.cpp", "dom/media/MediaShutdownManager.h"], "git_node": null, "git_parents": [null], "node": "590416f46ec89d90f7b5819212b56a08dbd4067f", "parents": ["6684a3c7f834b765624f437ebf943c469d1f44b1"], "tags": []}, {"author": "JW Wang \u003cjwwang@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 1336356 - Ensure MediaDecode::Shutdown() is called by MediaShutdownManager::BlockShutdown(). r=gerald a=jcristau", "files": ["dom/media/MediaDecoder.cpp", "dom/media/MediaDecoder.h", "dom/media/MediaDecoderOwner.h", "dom/media/MediaShutdownManager.cpp"], "git_node": null, "git_parents": [null], "node": "00ba83ac39be75bfd37ae65e8e8206ab8cb5e731", "parents": ["590416f46ec89d90f7b5819212b56a08dbd4067f"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Alex Chronopoulos \u003cachronop@gmail.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 1342363 - Uplift wasapi fixes to Beta. r=kinetik a=jcristau", "files": ["media/libcubeb/src/cubeb_wasapi.cpp", "media/libcubeb/update.sh", "media/libcubeb/uplift-wasapi-part-to-beta.patch"], "git_node": null, "git_parents": [null], "node": "10285b4a6b717bdd02644d87bbfda7fba45b37c4", "parents": ["00ba83ac39be75bfd37ae65e8e8206ab8cb5e731"], "tags": []}, {"author": "JW Wang \u003cjwwang@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 1343787 - Allow MediaShutdownManager::Register() to fail. r=gerald, a=jcristau\n\nAlso move the Register() calls to Load().", "files": ["dom/media/MediaDecoder.cpp", "dom/media/MediaShutdownManager.cpp", "dom/media/MediaShutdownManager.h", "dom/media/mediasource/MediaSourceDecoder.cpp", "dom/media/moz.build"], "git_node": null, "git_parents": [null], "node": "28287b7f0938f0d469cd10bb4a91151d10c7ec0d", "parents": ["10285b4a6b717bdd02644d87bbfda7fba45b37c4"], "tags": []}], "date": 1490366252, "git_changesets": [null, null, null, null, null, null, null, null, null, null, null, null], "user": "cbook@mozilla.com"}, "6975": {"changesets": [{"author": "Mike Conley \u003cmconley@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 1280079 - Make sure browser_privatebrowsing_newtab_from_popup.js accounts for initial browser remoteness flip when opening popup. r=mossop, a=test-only\n\nDuring the test, we open a new window which loads a URL, and have code to wait for that\ninitial browser to complete the load. For the initial browser, there is (when we open\na remote-able URL), the remoteness of that initial browser flips from non-remote to\nremote. Sometimes, due to messaging / timing, the initial browser will send a message\nsaying that a load completed for the initial about:blank before the URL we actually\nwant is loaded. This causes the test to continue, and attempt to click on an element\nthat isn't actually on the page yet.\n\nThis modification allows us to wait for the initial browser to actually load the page\nthat we care about before proceeding.\n\nI also changed some of the assertion messages to actually reflect what's being asserted,\nas opposed to reflecting what is being revealed if the assertion fails.\n\nMozReview-Commit-ID: 608SaA1nCVs", "files": ["browser/components/privatebrowsing/test/browser/browser_privatebrowsing_newtab_from_popup.js"], "git_node": null, "git_parents": [null], "node": "d2d79cb3dc239f9413f3690bcea2df9598ea4735", "parents": ["28287b7f0938f0d469cd10bb4a91151d10c7ec0d"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Matthew Gregan \u003ckinetik@flim.org\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 1292803 - Uplift cubeb_pulse timer race fix. r=achronop, a=jcristau", "files": ["media/libcubeb/bug1292803_pulse_assert.patch", "media/libcubeb/src/cubeb_pulse.c", "media/libcubeb/update.sh"], "git_node": null, "git_parents": [null], "node": "adbf7b59a40526e51e597d856fa94d47881f6f42", "parents": ["d2d79cb3dc239f9413f3690bcea2df9598ea4735"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Hannes Verschore \u003chv1989@gmail.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 1313869 - IonMonkey - Ensure ballast in ensureDefined. r=nbp, a=jcristau", "files": ["js/src/jit/Lowering.cpp"], "git_node": null, "git_parents": [null], "node": "eba25396310bf8365f2e26edcdbaf328967461cd", "parents": ["adbf7b59a40526e51e597d856fa94d47881f6f42"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Bob Owen \u003cbobowencode@gmail.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 1141756 - Part 1: Add null check for mPresShell in nsPrintEngine::GetSeqFrameAndCountPagesInternal. r=dholbert, a=jcristau", "files": ["layout/printing/nsPrintEngine.cpp"], "git_node": null, "git_parents": [null], "node": "f7c262517722225f5a32979e8939606aa95d8681", "parents": ["eba25